# ── Per-client environment ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy to .env.local for local work, and set the same values wherever
# the production build runs. All values here are PUBLIC — this is a
# static export, so anything prefixed NEXT_PUBLIC_ is compiled into the
# JavaScript the browser downloads. Never put a real secret here.

# ── Where the quote form sends ─────────────────────────────────────
# REQUIRED. Without it the form refuses to send and tells the visitor
# to call instead — the honest failure, rather than a success message
# over a lead that went nowhere.
#
# From web3forms.com, for the ccsofla@yahoo.com inbox. The key used to
# be written into contact.html; it is in this repo's git history, so
# create a new one and delete the old one in the Web3Forms dashboard.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
